# Glossary

> Template: the project's terms, so that people, planning sessions, and lanes use one word for one thing. Copy it to `docs/glossary.md` and delete every line that starts with `>`. A lane reads it when its contract names the planning repository in `reads`.

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Account | The record of one customer: their display name, email address, and sign-in |
| Display name | The name the product shows for a customer, which the customer chooses |
| Confirmed address | An email address whose owner followed the link sent to it |
